  "browseNoConnectionBody": "{source} could not be reached. Your library is unaffected.",
  "@browseNoConnectionBody": {
    "description": "⚠️ **`Your library is unaffected`**, and it is not reassurance for its own sake: SC-6 exists because a site that cannot be read looks like a broken app, and the reader's first fear is their library."
  },
