  "browseFailureUnknownCause": "The app cannot read its own record of this failure",
  "@browseFailureUnknownCause": {
    "description": "⚠️ **Not \"no connection\".** `CauseUnknown` means the app cannot read its own record; it does not mean the phone is offline, and a reader sent to check a setting that is already correct learns to distrust every error this app shows."
